WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:32.163
Everyone but Eddy was skidding.

2
00:00:32.164 --> 00:00:35.652
Suddenly Zippy flew by.

3
00:00:35.653 --> 00:00:40.433
Eddy jumped out of the way.

4
00:00:40.434 --> 00:00:43.989
Zippy skidded fast across the lot.

5
00:00:43.990 --> 00:00:47.920
His tires left long dark marks.

6
00:00:47.921 --> 00:00:52.138
Smoke filled the air.

7
00:00:52.139 --> 00:01:02.449
"Wow!" said Poppy.

8
00:01:02.450 --> 00:01:06.216
"That was cool, Zippy!" said the van.

9
00:01:06.217 --> 00:01:09.380
"I know," said Zippy.

10
00:01:09.381 --> 00:01:12.028
Zippy took off again.

11
00:01:12.029 --> 00:01:15.586
He stopped far away. His

12
00:01:15.587 --> 00:01:18.408
engine rumbled. "Watch

13
00:01:18.409 --> 00:01:21.761
this!" Zippy yelled. Roar!

14
00:01:21.762 --> 00:01:24.231
Zippy

15
00:01:24.232 --> 00:01:27.610
zoomed back toward everyone. He

16
00:01:27.611 --> 00:01:30.265
made a sharp turn. Then

17
00:01:30.266 --> 00:01:35.344
he skidded in circles! "Whoa!"

18
00:01:35.345 --> 00:01:38.643
said the jeep. "Zippy

19
00:01:38.644 --> 00:01:47.224
is the best!" said the van. "Yes,

20
00:01:47.225 --> 00:01:50.603
I am!" said Zippy. Suddenly—

21
00:01:50.604 --> 00:01:54.675
Roar!

22
00:01:54.676 --> 00:02:03.410
Eddy shot across the parking lot!

